{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"86372cbd4b76439edb9041576abb7dfc01d63bf176d0f30946645635dc750c60","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira reconciler mapping configuration","key_entities":["rebar bridge suggest-mapping","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/mapping_probe.py","src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/bridge.py","src/rebar/_cli/_bridge_commands.py","_bridge_suggest_mapping","src/rebar/_config_writer._emit_nested_toml","_emit_config_toml","mapping_config.py","adapters/jira_datacenter/transport.py","jira.JIRA.issue_types","jira.JIRA.priorities","jira.JIRA.issue_link_types","jira.JIRA.statuses","jira.JIRA.createmeta_issuetypes","jira.JIRA.createmeta_fieldtypes","jira.JIRA.search_issues","jira.JIRA.transitions","tool.rebar.mapping","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_probe.py"],"problem_keywords":["mapping configuration","jira probe","vocabulary discovery","issue types","statuses","link types","priorities","hierarchy","toml serialization","axis maps","createmeta","transitions"],"propositions":["A new read-only command `rebar bridge suggest-mapping` probes a live Jira project and emits a suggested `[tool.rebar.mapping]` configuration block with discovered vocabulary and identity-seeded axis maps.","The probe uses only public pycontribs jira.JIRA methods to discover issue types, statuses, link types, priorities, hierarchy levels, and createmeta fields without writing to Jira.","The `--write` flag persists the suggested mapping to rebar.toml via deep-merge under `[mapping.projects.<KEY>]`, preserving existing hand-edited values and flat sibling sections like `[jira]` and `[tracker]`.","Two new helpers `_emit_nested_toml` and `_emit_config_toml` in _config_writer.py orchestrate serialization of nested mapping tables while keeping the existing flat-only `_emit_toml` unchanged.","Transition hints are marked best-effort since per-issue `transitions()` calls return only transitions from each sample's current status, never a complete set."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787396629775094001,"uuid":"d60bc24d-5632-436e-95d2-5bfb74d8ce99"}